			"Message": "chore(submodules): Update all submodules to latest commits\n\nThis commit updates all submodules to their latest versions, bringing significant improvements across the CodeEditorLand ecosystem:\n\n- **Cocoon**: Adds comprehensive next session implementation plan (NEXT-SESSION-PLAN.md) detailing priorities and workflow for VSCode source analysis, service implementation, and Mountain integration. Updates progress tracking to reflect current foundation establishment.\n\n- **Mountain**: Introduces advanced IPC features module with performance monitoring, real-time collaboration session management, and intelligent message caching. Adds Tauri commands for frontend integration and background monitoring tasks.\n\n- **Wind**: Implements WindInstantiationService dependency injection framework for VSCode workbench integration, featuring service collection management, dependency graph resolution, and performance tracing capabilities.\n\n- **Maintain**: Internal improvements and updates.\n\nThese updates enhance the architectural foundation, improve synchronization between components, and add advanced features for performance monitoring and collaboration capabilities.",
