			"Message": "chore(submodules): Update all submodules to latest commits\n\nThis commit updates all submodules to their latest versions, bringing various improvements across the CodeEditorLand ecosystem:\n\n- **Cocoon**: Archives existing implementations and adds comprehensive documentation for upcoming reimplementation, including synchronization plans with Wind and Mountain components.\n- **Common & Echo**: Update @cloudflare/workers-types dependency to version 4.20260127.0 for enhanced TypeScript support in Cloudflare Workers development.\n- **Mountain**: Fixes nested configuration property handling in extension management and adds detailed IPC integration documentation between Mountain and Wind components.\n- **Sky**: Updates vite-plugin-static-copy dependency to 3.2.0 and implements a new atomic bootstrap system for the frontend with enhanced debugging capabilities and structured initialization flow.\n- **Other submodules** (Output, Rest, SideCar, Wind, Worker) are updated to their latest commits with various internal improvements.\n\nThese updates ensure better synchronization between components, improved dependency management, and enhanced architectural documentation for future development work.",
